  "details": "Version:---\nDescription of the bug:I can't find my account on my website\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nhttps://vrchat.com/home\nEntering your account name in the search window at the top of the site above does not return any results.\nThe same search result is obtained for both display name and ID. (See screenshot)\nI asked several friends to search, but they got the same search results.\nHowever, it seems that a unique user page can be accessed directly from a URL.\nUserID: regalo25\nDisplay Name:春雷（しゅんらい）\nUnique user page:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_b3a9549f-1228-461e-a167-c412482be047\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):Yes",
